Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:12.91,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,No Face to Wide Area Network 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:16.35,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,We will now begin \Nfull-scale combat operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:21.08,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,All Legion within this network \Nare to cease standby operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:25.18,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,All Legion within this network \Nare to cease standby operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:29.23,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,Our targets are the Giad Federacy \Nin the eastern region,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:33.53,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,the United Kingdom of Roa Gracia \Nto the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:37.51,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,the Alliance of Wald to the south,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:40.88,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,and the Republic of San Magnolia \Nto the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:44.47,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,All Legion attached to this network,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.19,Italics,No Face,0,0,0,,begin the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:28.35,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:31.44,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.58,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,At least say "wake up" \N{\i1}before{\i0} you yank out my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:36.04,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.42,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,They're finally coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:40.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:45.60,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(529,435)}August 28th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:42.94,Main Top,Raiden,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:44.75,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't want to even try to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.01,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,If anything, \NI wish somebody would tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:48.61,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:51.78,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,This is close to the worst case \NI'd imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:57.28,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Some of the forces I'd expected them to send \Nto other nations are headed for the Federacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:03:02.48,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The West appears to be the most \Nimportant theater to the Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:05.74,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:08.09,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:13.08,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,During the battle today, don't connect to me \Nunless you absolutely have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:18.95,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I thought I was used to it, \Nbut what I'm feeling tonight is rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:21.92,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:23.97,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'll let you get the unit prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.24,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Wake the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:28.15,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:31.42,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.80,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm waking up the entire army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.27,Main,Processor 1,0,0,0,,Shit. If this turns out to be a drill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:43.82,Main,Processor 1,0,0,0,,that so-called Reaper is gonna get \Nan "accidental" bullet to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.47,Main,Processor 2,0,0,0,,I'll shoot him where he stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:49.42,Main,Bernholt,0,0,0,,You two wouldn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.98,Main,Bernholt,0,0,0,,Stop talking and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:23.83,Main,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.41,Main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,Are those all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.73,Main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,There are so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:36.55,Main,Soldier 3,0,0,0,,Incoming fire for effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:47.77,Main,Soldier 4,0,0,0,,Defense Line 1 has taken heavy enemy damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:49.81,Main,Soldier 4,0,0,0,,Requesting reinforcements from the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.68,Main,Soldier 5,0,0,0,,Everybody who's still alive, \Ngather up your weapons and ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.98,Main,Soldier 5,0,0,0,,We're defending this place, \Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.86,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,We've calculated the enemy's total numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:11.44,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,Displaying on monitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:18.63,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,No... So every area in the theater \Nis under large-scale assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:22.63,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,This is far more than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:25.96,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,The western front is going to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:31.80,Italics,Comms,0,0,0,,The United Kingdom of Roa Gracia and the\N Alliance of Wald are experiencing similar attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:36.00,Italics,Comms,0,0,0,,They're both giving it their all, \Nbut I don't know that they'll be able to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:37.36,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:39.97,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Nouzen, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:41.06,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,When will you be ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:41.93,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:45.68,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Nordlicht squadron is all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.99,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,How are you ready so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.96,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,You did not authorize us to prepare,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.94,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,but please save any lectures for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:56.94,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,All right. Tell me \Nall about this later, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:01.09,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Maintain our combat lines until the other units \Nare ready to go, no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:02.66,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.60,Italics,Soldier 6,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.34,Main,Soldier 6,0,0,0,,The Löwes are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:11.54,Main,Soldier 7,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:14.09,Main,Soldier 8,0,0,0,,Don't go! \NNo one can save them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.14,Main,Soldier 8,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.28,Main,Soldier 8,0,0,0,,A Reginleif...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:58.23,Main,Soldier 8,0,0,0,,So this is Nordlicht squadron...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.80,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Are there any other survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:01.30,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Not any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.95,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,We're the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:05.81,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,The others were all killed \Nby those scrapheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:07.14,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:10.31,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Withdraw and regroup, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:13.08,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,We'll buy you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.62,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Okay... Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.02,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.28,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Look at 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:40.64,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Like ants that had their nest kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.62,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'll start with their commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:56.51,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'll be changing places, so back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.57,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Roger, Kurena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Leave the little ones to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.30,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:46.40,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,Don't shoot, Nordlicht squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:47.34,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,We're allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:50.21,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,That headless skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:52.21,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,You're the commander, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:56.48,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Shinei Nouzen, \Ncommander of Nordlicht squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:57.58,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:02.83,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,It appears we managed to drive off \Nthe first wave of Legion attackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:04.47,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,As have the other combat areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.91,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,This happened only because your emergency unit \Nmanaged to hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.45,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,You saved a lot of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:13.61,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,The other units have all launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.13,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:19.70,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,Fall back and resupply, \Nthen follow orders from command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:23.41,Italics,Pilot,0,0,0,,The Federacy will handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:26.14,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that last Legion unit\N was just an advance force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.57,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The second group is the main one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:29.94,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If we fall back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.15,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,this area will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:32.62,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.72,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,We'll leave this area to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.65,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,We're going to intercept the main wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:41.18,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,If we can take down the front line \Nof their advance, it will slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:43.13,Main,Pilot,0,0,0,,Wait, Lieutenant. \NWhat do you mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:44.53,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Transmission over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:48.26,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,You all heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:50.59,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Follow me if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:51.46,Italics,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.86,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,Take all the ammo we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.49,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,The minute a truck is full up, it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:59.15,Main,Supply guy,0,0,0,,Sergeant, our spares are ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:01.37,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,Have them ready to go when ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.07,Main,Supply guy,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:05.45,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,Listen to me! \NDon't make Fido come get anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.69,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,He needs to concentrate \Non supporting the commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.29,Main,Sergeant,0,0,0,,Bringing supplies to the front \Nwhen they're needed is our job!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:25.81,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:09.02,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Looks like we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:16.02,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If only I knew where Kiri was, \NI could help them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.85,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:45.49,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,The second wave is being held off \Nin all combat areas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:49.15,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,Nordlicht squadron has begun advancing \Non the enemy's main formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.43,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,They're still fighting on the front lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.48,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,They're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.11,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Shinei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.02,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Shinei, Kiri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:22.55,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:24.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Kiri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:30.87,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:40.36,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Shinei...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.43,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.53,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.34,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.46,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.50,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:26.20,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You mustn't keep fighting like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.72,Italics,Grethe,0,0,0,,Command to all members \Nof Nordlicht squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.12,Italics,Grethe,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:21.64,Italics,Grethe,0,0,0,,The Legion are falling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.26,Italics,Grethe,0,0,0,,Return to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:29.43,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.49,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Frederica?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:58.94,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:03.97,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're just like Kiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:11.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You huge fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:32.03,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,475)}August 25th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:33.14,Italics Top,Soldier,0,0,0,,This is Northern Combat Lines \NCombat District 1 Squadron 1, Sledgehammer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:37.78,Italics,Soldier,0,0,0,,To all Eighty-Six Processors \Nhearing this message...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:43.17,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,This is Sledgehammer Combat Commander, Blackbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.94,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Our war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.04,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,All Processors hearing this message...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.02,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,All who fought to the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:53.07,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,All who survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:57.01,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,We're finally leaving the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:01.38,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,We all did our best, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.60,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,You get what you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:30.93,Main,Rep Officer 1,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.51,Main,Rep Officer 1,0,0,0,,A movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.80,Main,Rep Officer 2,0,0,0,,Somebody turn off that alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.61,Main,Rep Officer 2,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.25,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,The Gran Mur...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:43.85,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,The railgun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:51.12,Italics,Annette,0,0,0,,Lena, that warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.42,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,I may as well let you know, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.75,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,The main attack came from the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:57.51,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,The north side's fallen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:01.53,Italics,Shiden,0,0,0,,and the east and west are under attack \Nfrom the north, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.97,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Yes, Annette, Cyclops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:05.74,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.20,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,It's finally time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.28,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,What do you think \Nyou're doing, Captain Milizé?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:17.35,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,General Karlstahl...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.28,0:17:24.62,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm bringing all squadrons \Nfrom all areas inside the Gran Mur
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:28.50,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,to build a defense line \Nbefore the Legion reach District 1
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.27,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,and intercept the enemy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.06,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,If we do that, we may still survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.11,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:39.21,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,The people of the Republic would be better off \Nbeing destroyed by the Legion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:41.86,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,than letting Eighty-Six inside the Gran Mur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.00,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Are you still—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:47.34,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,The Eighty-Six will never fight \Nfor the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:52.27,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,The Republic oppressed, abandoned, \Nand slaughtered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:56.20,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Even if we beg them to protect us now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.43,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,they have no reason or obligation to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:03.26,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,The most they'll do is laugh \Nand tell us we're getting what we deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.64,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They aren't obligated, but they do have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:14.89,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,We possess manufacturing and \Npower plants that they don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:19.18,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,They've spent enough time on the battlefield \Nthat when it comes down to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:23.16,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,they'll decide that \Nthey need those things to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:26.25,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,They may obey us at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:33.86,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,but they'll soon realize that it would be \Nmuch easier to fight the Legion alone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:38.22,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,than protect a bunch of useless citizens \Nwho do nothing but complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:40.40,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,And what will happen then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.87,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, \Nit will just be a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:48.80,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,But you've studied enough history \Nto know that that won't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:51.83,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:57.69,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up on everything \Nor just wait to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:00.36,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Even if I'm going to fail and die,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.39,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I want to fight \Nuntil that moment comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:07.25,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:11.62,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,The ones who did the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:16.00,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,The ones who believed \Nthat I could do the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:18.86,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to face them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:24.39,Italics,Announce,0,0,0,,We have an explanation \Nregarding the warning a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:28.32,Italics,Announce,0,0,0,,Soldiers and officers, \Nplease come to the meeting hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:29.62,Italics,Announce,0,0,0,,I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.41,Italics,Announce,0,0,0,,We have an explanation \Nregarding the warning a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:36.22,Italics,Announce,0,0,0,,Soldiers and officers, \Nplease come to the meeting hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.83,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Then do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:43.37,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Follow your impossible dream \Nuntil you're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:50.41,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,It's a child's right to dream, Captain Milizé,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:53.12,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,and until that child wakes up \Nfrom her dream
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:55.93,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,and is crushed against the rocks \Nof a merciless reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:59.89,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,it's an adult's job to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.60,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,I can buy you time, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:06.25,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Did you always intend to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:09.22,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,It's time for you to be crushed, Lena,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:15.66,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,as you watch your naïve dreams\N shatter against reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.07,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Wait, uncle—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:30.98,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Good luck, General Karlstahl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:39.05,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm going to reach that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:49.75,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Para-RAID, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:53.34,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Synchronization target: \NAll processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:20:59.70,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Synchronization complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:06.25,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Bloody Regina to all Processors \Nin all combat areas!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:09.11,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,A large-scale Legion offensive has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:12.67,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,You are to gather within the 85 districts \Nand begin combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:16.14,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,All personnel within National Defense HQ,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:19.00,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,remove anti-personnel mines \Nand open the Gran Mur's gates immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.92,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Everything we've done was for this day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.14,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,To protect our honor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.91,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,Let's fight until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:03.40,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,On that day, \NKiri attacked the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:08.56,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What I saw was a shattered wall \Nand a burning five-color flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:12.07,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,And a huge Legion...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:14.05,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:16.73,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,They're inside the 85 districts?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:18.65,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It's probably all over then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:19.64,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:23.01,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Is he still attacking the Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:25.08,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,No, now he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:29.25,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.25,0:23:30.50,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Get down! Kiri is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:38.01,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"I won't forget."
